EmbedEval Model Benchmarks
Personal benchmark records and a manual scoring adapter, 2026.

This work includes prompts derived from EmbedEval by Ecro and contributors.
Source: https://github.com/Ecro/embedeval
Pinned revision: fdbcb9b93476149cce2d395532bf5164811fe053
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The local adapter selects public Bugfix variants and invokes the unchanged
upstream L0/L3 checker logic. This is not the official EmbedEval leaderboard.
The publication adds sanitized result exports, integrity verification,
documentation, and a portable local web scorer. Upstream source is fetched
separately at the pinned revision; CRLF formatting reproduces recorded hashes.

Model final answers are preserved as research artifacts. Existing notices in
those answers are retained. No account data, credentials, model reasoning text,
or original transport logs are distributed in this repository.
